{"3280150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lone Chef", "steam_appid": 3280150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rediscover the lost art of cooking in a post-apocalyptic world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time when cooking has been forgotten, take on the role of a lone chef on a quest for the ultimate dish. Travel across mysterious lands, meet delightful companions, and craft a story all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield kitchen tools as weapons in side-scrolling action battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dynamic enemies and bosses that change with the day-night cycle. Cook meals to grow stronger, or learn powerful new skills from fellow adventurers you encounter. Make the most of every resource to defeat foes and uncover rare, high-value ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fiery feast awaits at every campsite.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving wilderness, nothing is more important than a hearty meal. Use your hunted ingredients to whip up gourmet meals—or surprising creations you never expected. Explore every hidden corner and uncover rare recipes hidden off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices shape the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with charming characters over shared meals and heartfelt conversations. Your decisions impact relationships—some will blossom, others may fall apart. Every choice opens new narrative paths, making each playthrough a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/7d8692eba3f7cc5169ba48dd31c49745.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rediscover the lost art of cooking in a post-apocalyptic world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a time when cooking has been forgotten, take on the role of a lone chef on a quest for the ultimate dish. Travel across mysterious lands, meet delightful companions, and craft a story all your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/f84e0a42353893cee8cc7312078e2995.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wield kitchen tools as weapons in side-scrolling action battles.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against dynamic enemies and bosses that change with the day-night cycle. Cook meals to grow stronger, or learn powerful new skills from fellow adventurers you encounter. Make the most of every resource to defeat foes and uncover rare, high-value ingredients.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/6313e458a2eb61159780b5b95de65579.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A fiery feast awaits at every campsite.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the unforgiving wilderness, nothing is more important than a hearty meal. Use your hunted ingredients to whip up gourmet meals—or surprising creations you never expected. Explore every hidden corner and uncover rare recipes hidden off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.poster.avif?t=1787536718\" width=700 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.webm?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/extras/97722106fa5e917f39b9b8fd64de5845.mp4?t=1787536718\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your choices shape the story.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bond with charming characters over shared meals and heartfelt conversations. Your decisions impact relationships—some will blossom, others may fall apart. Every choice opens new narrative paths, making each playthrough a unique experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "&quot;Who dares to build on my land?!&quot; The Dark Lord destroyed the restaurant the Chef worked so hard to build... And so begins the Chef's deliciously dramatic quest for revenge! But first... an empty stomach makes for a poor adventure. Better grab something to eat before heading out!", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Italian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/cd80ea37300fed0e7c48491ae8ae6153128bba35/header.jpg?t=1787536718", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/fce37c6765c9a2304356224c74b2ce0a733d3e5b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787536718", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280150/fce37c6765c9a2304356224c74b2ce0a733d3e5b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787536718", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=